 "description": "The Cisco 4400 Series Wireless LAN Controllers provide centralized control and scalability for medium to large-scale Government and Enterprise wireless LAN networks and support the IEEE 802.11i wireless security standard while meeting the Wi-Fi Alliances interoperability specification WPA2 for Secure Wireless Architecture. The Cisco WLAN Controllers support voice, video and data services, intrusion detection, intrusion protection and intelligent radio resource management and comply with the wireless security policies issued by the U.S. Federal Government and the Department of Defense (DoD).",
